    </plurals>
    <plurals name="delete_body">
        <item quantity="one">If you move it to the trash you can restore it for %1$d day. If you delete it permanently, it is removed immediately and, if it is a folder, so is everything inside it.</item>
        <item quantity="other">If you move it to the trash you can restore it for %1$d days. If you delete it permanently, it is removed immediately and, if it is a folder, so is everything inside it.</item>
